<title>JAPAN: Kinki Nippon -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kinki Nippon -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		133.39		vs	  121.67</p>
<p> Operating	   18.44		vs	   14.74</p>
<p> Current		9.03		vs	    5.50</p>
<p> Net		    5.13		vs	    4.76</p>
<p> EPS		    3.18 yen	  vs	    3.03 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   1.62 billion	  vs	1.57 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kinki Nippon Railway Co Ltd is the country's largest private railway operator in operating mileage.</p>
